    "verifier_inputs": {
      "$comment": "RFC-0018 SI-3 (amended 2026-11-15): the system page's Statement block. Each row names the fields of the claim card that say it; the page prints their text, linked to their source, or \"not stated\". `program` is the verifier this configuration runs and times; `untimed` names the publisher's other verifiers, which no session times; `reply` says where that verifier takes the reply from: the harness record (the adapter passes the claimed reply) or the proof itself. It lives here, not in the claim card, because the v1.0 runs record the card's digest (RFC-0014 §Eligibility)",
